{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/61da2da66227160f179bb34711993b35.avif?t=1765532788\" width=920 height=148 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf88 A Balloon-Bound Co-Op Adventure \ud83c\udf88</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a kingdom where magic once ruled the skies... until an evil sorcerer plunged it into chaos. Now, the fate of the realm rests in the hands (well, strings?) of two unlikely heroes: Gus Flint, a cocky prince with zero magical training, and Poe Rob, a timid young wizard searching for his missing mother. Their quest? Reclaim the kingdom. Their problem? They\u2019ve been turned into humanoid balloons. Yep. Balloons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 What\u2019s the Vibe?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think whimsical medieval fantasy meets chaotic co-op platforming. You and a friend will float, bounce, and inflate your way through a vibrant world packed with puzzles, peril, and plenty of personality. But this isn\u2019t just about saving the kingdom\u2014it\u2019s about saving each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/ea3138e69d28c09fcc3f01d0ab1ca5d4.avif?t=1765532788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras_big/ea3138e69d28c09fcc3f01d0ab1ca5d4.avif?t=1765532788 width=800 height=654 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inflate to Elevate</strong>: Take turns puffing up each other\u2019s heads to float through enchanted levels. It\u2019s weird. It\u2019s hilarious. It\u2019s brilliant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork is Everything</strong>: You\u2019ll need tight coordination to dodge traps, outwit enemies, and solve puzzles. One wrong move and it\u2019s deflation nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/641abbbb3f4fea4d25480ea4c06172bf.poster.avif?t=1765532788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/641abbbb3f4fea4d25480ea4c06172bf.webm?t=1765532788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Meet the Balloon Bros</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gus</strong>: A prince with swagger, but not a lot of wisdom. He\u2019s bold, brash, and totally unprepared for this magical mess. If you\u2019re impulsive and wear your heart on your sleeve, Gus is your guy. \ud83c\udfaf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poe</strong>: A brainy but emotionally distant sorcerer-in-training. He\u2019s logical, cautious, and haunted by the mystery of his <span class=\"bb_strike\">missing mom</span>. If you\u2019re a thinker with a soft spot for angsty characters, Poe\u2019s your pick. \ud83e\uddea</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they\u2019ll learn to trust, grow, and maybe\u2014<i>just maybe</i>\u2014become the heroes their kingdom needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/e78b0918493b04945812f5b25c0af433.avif?t=1765532788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras_big/e78b0918493b04945812f5b25c0af433.avif?t=1765532788 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Campaign</strong>: Play through five acts, each with three handcrafted levels. Perfect for couch co-op or online chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Worlds</strong>: From floating libraries to magical parks, each level bursts with color, charm, and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling</strong>: Dive into a tale of friendship, redemption, and self-discovery. Watch Gus and Poe evolve as they face their fears\u2014and each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; Lore</strong>: Discover hidden comics, collectibles, and off-topic lore pages that deepen the world and its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/18c6af3092e095f4f90806c8dac10c26.poster.avif?t=1765532788\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/18c6af3092e095f4f90806c8dac10c26.webm?t=1765532788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve ever wanted to test your friendship, laugh until you cry, and float through a fantasy world full of heart and humor\u2014this is your game. <i>Make Me Float</i> is more than a platformer. It\u2019s a story about growing up, letting go, and learning to lift each other up <u>(literally)</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/3fc0f402c54f30eb6dcd12c9392dcac4.poster.avif?t=1765532788\" width=754 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/3fc0f402c54f30eb6dcd12c9392dcac4.webm?t=1765532788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/3fc0f402c54f30eb6dcd12c9392dcac4.mp4?t=1765532788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/extras/6815a159292c5de7f402247eb76928dd.avif?t=1765532788\" width=500 height=590 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udece\ufe0f Wishlist <i>Make Me Float</i> now and be the first to bounce into action when the magic hits Steam! \ud83d\udece\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2165530?t=1765532788","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/2f3943a8d4fe3a532ddf6864000c20c0bb225500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765532788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/6d09b1d24b0c8129a75c9db3d652e0a56aeab3cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765532788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165530/6d09b1d24b0c8129a75c9db3d652e0a56aeab3cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765532788","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2407150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"